ss=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-02T14:18:17-08:00","id":1181796,"title":"","content":"They could start with some of the short stories if they don't want to produce a whole novel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-04T03:30:42-08:00","id":1182215,"title":"","content":"Last time I've checked, there wasn't good voices in those programs which read text, I'm not up-to-date with that kind of software, though, if that was what you were asking.<br /> <br /> If you're asking about WoD novels in audio format, that would be a good idea, although, considering Onyx Path said there wasn't a good market for the novels and consumers are less interested in those, it's very unlikely OPP or WW would be very interested in funding (in the case of OPP) and making those, unless another company wants to finance the project and WW licenses it to them, now if we talk about old novels chances seem to be even smaller, perhaps new novels would have a better chance to get that treatment.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/864050-world-of-darkness-novels-converted-to-audiobook-format?p=865139#post865139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...having a thick south american accent...</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't know what you mean with you having a South American accent, considering there are several accents in South America, even within the different regions and cities from the different countries, plus, you have some Brazilians who can speak Spanish as their second language and talking about languages, let's not forget that Suriname, Guyana and French Guiana speak other languages which are not Spanish. With South America I suppose you mean some country in the south between Colombia in the north and way below in the south of the region, I'm saying that, because, for example, some people in USA and Mexico have their own interpretation about where the South American region begins.<br /> <br /> Now going back to the main topic, I'd say that probably WW and OPP might not be happy with that offer, about reading and sharing their novels through a different media, so, if you're interested on doing it, it's probably better for everybody that you ask for permission from WW and you'll probably get it, as WW are more open to projects from fans, after they set the rules for that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1846-nen","name":"NEN","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-08T16:21:15-08:00","id":1183753,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NEN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/864050-world-of-darkness-novels-converted-to-audiobook-format?p=1182215#post1182215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Last time I've checked, there wasn't good voices in those programs which read text, I'm not up-to-date with that kind of software, though, if that was what you were asking.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have the impression that even the best text-reading programs have wooden-sounding voices at best, and would be a major turnoff compared to an actual voice actor reading the story to you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NEN</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/864050-world-of-darkness-novels-converted-to-audiobook-format?p=1182215#post1182215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don't know what you mean with you having a South American accent, considering there are several accents in South America...</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Thick South American accent&quot; is equivalent to &quot;Thick North American accent.&quot; Sure, there are thick accents all over North America, but people in Quebec City sound very different from people in Mexico City, and they sound very different from people in Charlotte, Brooklyn, Minneapolis, Baton Rouge, Boston, San Francisco, etc. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13713-wilson","name":"Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"182"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-23T17:16:20-08:00","id":1189047,"title":"","content":"when i started this thread years ago in 2016 I didn't think years later in 2018 people would bring it back like I've always said onyx path should a deal with with audible or graphic audio to produce i know both i and my father would love to listen to world of darkness audio books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/962-the-viking-anarch","name":"the viking anarch","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}